      "id": "claim_c6e86175c3654cae90e9d221c80133cd",
      "statement": "The app uses bearer token authentication with tokens stored in localStorage, a 15-minute TTL, silent renewal at ~80% via scheduleRefresh, and an HTTP interceptor that attaches the token to all API calls and clears the session on 401.",
