      "id": "claim_5f494858f28c4186b9e05d18223d9c79",
      "statement": "A team has id.$oid (MongoDB ObjectId), name, description, role (owner|member), and active flag. Team creation happens on signup with \"{firstName}'s Team\" as the name. Team deletion is only possible when no other members remain, enforced by the backend with a 409 response.",
