      "id": "claim_5cb0f26fc8b146a1b2d932c86fb5d0e0",
      "statement": "Invitation resend has a 5-minute cooldown. The countdown starts from each pending invitation's last send: withLastSends records invite.createdAt for non-expired invites when invitations load. The service refuses a resend within 5 minutes; a refused resend surfaces the service's reason via resendError. A zoneless now signal ticking every 30 seconds keeps the countdown and the disabled Resend button live.",
