      "id": "claim_9594094cb0724f7ba92a674c5d832419",
      "statement": "The consents gate is a server-enforced acceptance requirement: a Guards rule returns HTTP 451 to authenticated requests from users whose latestConsents does not match current TOS/PP versions. The client catches 451 via consentsOnError and shows an overlay outside the router outlet.",
