      "statement": "consents.ts is a plain module (not a service) because onError is passed to provideRhAuth during injector construction before DI is available. consents-gate.ts has two checkbox signals gating the Accept button; on success it performs a pathname-aware reload: if on /auth/*, navigates to /; otherwise reloads the current page to preserve any in-progress flow (e.g., invitation acceptance).",
